  "Rooms": [
    {
      "Id": 28700,
      "Name": "The Pub",
      "Description": "\n   Through the smoke and noise, you can see what appears to be a seedy\ntavern.  The bar, while well-stocked, looks to be in some disrepair,\nburn marks and scuffs abound.  Several tables, which appear to have been\nbroken and fixed many times, fill the center of the room, and booths\nwith high walls ensure privacy for those looking to transact the\noccasional shady deal.  Behind the bar hangs a sign: \n\n                       #yAll alcohol must be paid for \n                   Water is self-serve... the management#N",
      "ZoneId": 287,
      "Sector": "Inside",
      "Flags": [
