      "Description": "\n   Here is the gathering place of the guild.  The long hall is filled with\nbenches enough to accommodate a small army.  At the end of the hall is a\ntall chair made entirely of bones, several of which you can not\nidentify... those you can sending shivers through your body.  Above the\nchair lies a simple plaque:  \n \n                          #yDisce doce#N",
