    {
      "Id": 28706,
      "Name": "The Mad Prophet's Chamber",
      "Description": "\n   Here lives a madman.  A man whose mind was torn apart by the forces of\nMagic, and the responsibility of controlling it.  He has spent millennia\nrecovering from the damage done to his mind, and has once again decided\nto try and help mankind.  By spending his life dedicated to helping the\nweak he hopes to make amends for his sins.  Wise in the way of the\nworld, his mad ravings contain secrets you would do well to learn.",
      "ZoneId": 287,
      "Sector": "Inside",
      "Flags": [
        "Indoors",
