      "Id": 28707,
      "Name": "The Tavern Commons",
      "Description": "\n   Here sleeping space has been provided for those in need of a rest.  The\nbunks are uncomfortable, the room chilly, and the bedding sparse.  But\nthen... what do you want for free?  The guild sponsors hope to one day\nimprove the conditions of the Four Winds, but they have only so much\nmoney.",
